Data shipped in data/ (details and links in data/README.md):
- fountains-corsica.geojson, stops-corsica.geojson: © OpenStreetMap
  contributors, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
- fountains-ign-corsica.geojson: IGN, BD TOPO®, Licence Ouverte 2.0. Source: IGN
- onde-observations.csv, training.csv: stream observations of the ONDE network
  (Office français de la biodiversité), through Hub'Eau, Licence Ouverte 2.0
- gauge-normals-1991-2020.json, training.csv: computed from Météo-France daily
  climatological data (« Données climatologiques de base - quotidiennes »),
  Licence Ouverte 2.0. Source: Météo-France.
- Elevations in training.csv: IGN (Géoplateforme altimetry), Licence Ouverte 2.0

At run time the tool also reads the Météo-France forecast models through
Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com, CC BY 4.0).
